            <ArticleTitle>Vaginal cuff dehiscence with bowel evisceration after robotic hysterectomy.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>249-251</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.4274/tjod.47640</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Vaginal cuff dehisence with bowel evisceration after hysterectomy is a very rare complication. However, the incidance of this complication appears to be increased with the widely used techniques of laparoscopic surgery especially with robotic hysterectomy. In this case report we aimed to evaluate the risk factors and treatment methods for this complication.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
